# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — OHOS/CI 无 protoc-c：protobuf-c 预生成交付 + ohpcd protobuf 的 zlib::zlib shim ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-29（配套 md 补录；原始来源 riemann-c-client/1.10.4，2026-09-25，contrib-14160）
# Software: riemann-c-client 1.10.4；同族先例 ocserv 1.5.0
# Gate: autotools configure / make codegen / CMake 工具构建
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: DRAFT-E725-ohos-protoc-c-pregenerated-pb-c
title: OHOS/CI 无 protoc-c：protobuf-c 代码生成的预生成交付套路（含 ohpcd protobuf 的 zlib::zlib shim）
trigger_tool: autotools|configure|make|CMake|protoc-c
phase: build|codegen
error_signature: |-
  You need protoc-c installed and on your path to proceed|
  protoc-c: command not found|
  The link interface of target "protobuf::libprotobuf" contains:.*zlib::zlib.*but the target was not found|
  Error relocating .*gnutls_.*: symbol not found
severity: 3
category: ohos|build-system|codegen|conan
match_keywords: protoc-c, protoc-gen-c, protobuf-c, zlib::zlib, find_dependency, 预生成, pb-c, gnutls
approach: 三条判定 + 处置链：① `command -v protoc-c protoc-gen-c protoc` 皆空且制品仓无导出二进制
  （protobuf-c/1.5.1 的 package() 已 rmtree(bin/)）→ 走「预生成交付」：在受控环境生成
  *.pb-c.[ch] 后随源码/补丁交付；② protobuf-targets.cmake 的 INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES 写了
  zlib::zlib 但 protobuf-config.cmake 无 find_dependency(zlib) → 注入 zlib::zlib shim 或补
  find_dependency；③ conaninfo.txt 声明 shared=False 实物却只有 .so → 按实物修正链接/依赖声明。
  完整可复现 bootstrap 命令与路径见配套 md。
source: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-E725-ohos-protoc-c-pregenerated-pb-c.md
last_updated: 2026-09-29
